    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 68 ('Bergram Stumpfinger's Ghost (the live random encounter: Bergram Stumpfinger's ghost outside the Haunted Mines)'): scene bs_random_encounter_01, entry, exit, 4 waves, 15 spawns ({'Ghost Miner': 8, 'Ghost Pirate': 6, 'Bergram Stumpfinger': 1})."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Every spot inside the scene is the fork's generated layout, not an original one. Zone number 1249 is the fork's; ours must be assigned and the scene bs_random_encounter_01 has not been loaded by our server yet (the eleven shipped battles all use sg_random_encounter_clearing). Triggers: at-start spawns are actors, later waves follow the one before (the fork's 1.5 s delay is dropped). Knockouts and score are the design's defaults; coins and XP are the shipped battles' values, not the fork's 75 coins / 260 stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: this scene needs one native load, and the starter or door of `entry` is drawn by the entrances work, not by this file. Each kind's rank here decides its health and hit at the fight's tier."
