      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "rc-0137 prize wheel: fandom 'Bergram Stumpfinger's Ghost' (revision 49163) lists one prize wheel per combat job and a 26-coin slot; any other job spins the items every job's wheel holds. Medic: 'Energy Transfer Medic Pants' is in no catalogue or record, left off."
